"We couldn’t finish the safety copy. Check the card reader and allow macOS to read your card, then try again. The activity log has more information." = "備份未能完成。請檢查讀卡機，並允許 macOS 讀取記憶卡後再試一次。你可以展開執行紀錄，查看詳細資訊。";
