"We’ll make the safety copy for you, then recover from it. macOS may show “authopen” in its permission request; it opens the card only for reading. Keep the card connected until copying finishes." = "CardMe 會先備份整張記憶卡，再從備份中救回照片。macOS 可能會顯示「authopen」的權限要求，這只會以唯讀方式開啟記憶卡。備份完成前，請保持記憶卡連接。";
"We’ll read the whole card and save a safety copy called card.img in the folder you choose. Then we’ll search that copy for photos. Nothing on your card will be changed.\n\nThis takes longer and needs more than %@ of free space, plus room for the rescued photos. We’ll check the space before starting.\n\nThis search supports JPEG photos and may also find small previews. Overwritten photos or photos split across different areas may not be recoverable. RAW photos aren’t supported.\n\n%@" = "CardMe 會讀取整張記憶卡，在你選擇的資料夾建立一份 card.img 備份，再從備份尋找照片。記憶卡內容不會被更動。\n\n這個步驟需要較多時間，也需要超過 %@ 的可用空間，另外還要預留救回照片的空間。開始前會先確認容量是否足夠。\n\n目前支援 JPEG 照片，也可能找到較小的預覽照片。已被覆寫或分散在不同區域的照片，不一定能救回。目前不支援 RAW 照片。\n\n%@";
"You can also check photos in a folder or search a previously saved safety copy of a card." = "你也可以檢查資料夾中的照片，或從之前儲存的記憶卡備份尋找照片。";
